# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Files Docker / ACR Tasks must NOT send as build context.
# Smaller context = faster uploads, better caching, nothing leaked into images.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Build outputs and tool caches
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.angular/
**/.vs/
**/*.user

# Generated locally by `ng build`. The image builds its own copy in Stage 1,
# so a stale local copy must never sneak in.
src/ResolveLite.Api/wwwroot/

# Developer-only settings never go into an image
**/appsettings.Development.json

# Not needed to build the app
.git/
.github/
docs/
deploy/
tests/
